后台没有配置 GitHub OAuth App 时，站点说明不提供 GitHub 登录，发起授权、兑换和解绑都返回 NOT_FOUND。这个场景的请求会跟随跳转，所以回调的跳转目标见 TestGitHubOAuthAppChanges。

-- request --
GET /api/site
-- response --
200
{"brandName": "Alisten", "registrationOpen": true, "githubLogin": false}

-- request --
POST /api/members

{}
-- response --
201
{"memberToken": "$alice", "member": {"id": "$aliceId", "name": "$aliceName", "avatarHash": ""}}

-- request --
POST /api/auth/github
Authorization: Bearer $alice

{"intent": "login", "nonce": "0123456789abcdef"}
-- response --
404
{"error": {"code": "NOT_FOUND", "message": "站点没有开启 GitHub 登录"}}

-- request --
POST /api/auth/github/exchange
Authorization: Bearer $alice

{"code": "anything", "nonce": "0123456789abcdef"}
-- response --
404
{"error": {"code": "NOT_FOUND", "message": "站点没有开启 GitHub 登录"}}

-- request --
POST /api/account/github/removals
Authorization: Bearer $alice

{"currentPassword": "correct horse"}
-- response --
404
{"error": {"code": "NOT_FOUND", "message": "站点没有开启 GitHub 登录"}}
